---
title: Peaucellier–Lipkin Linkage
date: 2026-09-30
---
{% extends "page.njk" %}
{% block head -%}
{{ super() }}
<style>
#linkage-wrap {
  position: relative;
  margin: 1em 0;
}
#linkage {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  border-radius: 4px;
  touch-action: none;
}
#linkage-msg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 1em;
  text-align: center;
  color: #c9302c;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.pl-controls {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr 3.5em;
  gap: 0.4em 0.8em;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 1em 0;
}
.pl-controls label {
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.pl-controls input[type=range] {
  width: 100%;
}
.pl-controls output {
  text-align: right;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.pl-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5em 1.2em;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 1em 0;
}
.pl-btn {
  font-size: 1em;
  line-height: 1;
  padding: 0.4em 0.9em;
  background-color: #337ab7;
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.pl-btn:hover {
  background-color: #286090;
}
#pl-info {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
</style>
{%- endblock %}
{% block pagecontent -%}
<p>The <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peaucellier%E2%80%93Lipkin_linkage">Peaucellier–Lipkin
linkage</a> (1864) was the first planar linkage that converts circular motion
into exact straight-line motion. Adjust the lengths below and watch the
straight line traced by the point <i>P′</i> (red). You can also drag the crank
point <i>P</i>. See the post <a href="/posts/peaucellier-lipkin-linkage/">Peaucellier–Lipkin
Linkage</a> for an explanation of how it works.</p>

<div id="linkage-wrap">
  <canvas id="linkage"></canvas>
  <div id="linkage-msg" hidden></div>
</div>

<div class="pl-buttons">
  <button id="pl-play" class="pl-btn">Pause</button>
  <button id="pl-clear" class="pl-btn">Clear trace</button>
</div>

<div class="pl-controls">
  <label for="pl-L">Long arms <i>L</i> (OA, OB)</label>
  <input type="range" id="pl-L" min="1" max="8" step="0.05" value="5">
  <output for="pl-L" id="pl-L-out"></output>

  <label for="pl-s">Rhombus side <i>s</i></label>
  <input type="range" id="pl-s" min="0.5" max="6" step="0.05" value="2">
  <output for="pl-s" id="pl-s-out"></output>

  <label for="pl-r">Crank <i>r</i> (CP, OC)</label>
  <input type="range" id="pl-r" min="0.5" max="6" step="0.05" value="1.75">
  <output for="pl-r" id="pl-r-out"></output>

  <label for="pl-speed">Speed</label>
  <input type="range" id="pl-speed" min="0" max="3" step="0.05" value="1">
  <output for="pl-speed" id="pl-speed-out"></output>
</div>

<p id="pl-info"></p>

{%- endblock %}
{% block bodyend -%}
<script src="peaucellier.js"></script>
{{ super() }}
{%- endblock %}
